//! Native backend module root — MIR → x86_64 machine code without LLVM.
//!
//! ## Architecture
//!
//! ```
//! compiler-tml/src/native/
//!   common.tml           — this file, module root and re-exports
//!   machir.tml           — MachIR data types (VirtualReg, MachInst, MachBlock, MachFunc)
//!   mir_lower.tml        — MIR → MachIR lowering
//!   stack_alloc.tml      — stack-only register allocation (MVP fallback)
//!   liveness.tml         — dataflow liveness analysis, live interval computation
//!   linear_scan.tml      — Poletto/Sarkar linear scan register allocator
//!   coff_emit.tml        — PE/COFF data structures and section builders
//!   obj_writer.tml       — COFF object file writer
//!   pipeline.tml         — end-to-end native compilation pipeline
//!   x86/
//!     encode.tml         — x86_64 integer instruction encoding (MOV, ADD, SUB, etc.)
//!     emit.tml           — MachIR → x86_64 bytes with two-pass branch patching
//!     sse.tml            — SSE2/SSE4/AVX2 float + atomic instruction encoding
//!     frame.tml          — stack frame prologue/epilogue emission
//!     peephole.tml       — post-regalloc peephole optimization
//!     const_prop.tml     — MachIR-level constant propagation
//!     calling_conv.tml   — Win64 and SysV AMD64 calling conventions
//! ```

